# Newsletter issues live here, one YAML file per send.
#
# The filename becomes the URL slug, so date-lead it and keep it stable:
#   2026-08-16-confidential-funds.yaml  ->  /newsletter/2026-08-16-confidential-funds
#
# Schema is `newsletter` in src/content.config.ts. Required: title,
# description, sentAt, intro, items[]. A URL that has been mailed out cannot be
# changed, so rename before the send, never after.
#
# This file only exists to keep the empty directory in git. Delete it once the
# first issue lands.
